{"id":"vod_bf_22449","vodId":"22449","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"美少女战士Crystal第一季","name_cn":"美少女战士Crystal第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-23/00aadc9e1eb429c70cc21b256259c0a7.jpg"},"summary":"据悉，在很早之前就有付出过动画化消息的《美少女战士Sailor Moon》，但是一直都没有相应后续的消息发布，直至今日，才刚刚发布了此作动画化的相关消息，据了解，其现在官方终于发布了新作动画终于迎来了开播日期的相关消息，已经确定《美少女战士》动画版将在今年夏季7月进行开播，敬请关注吧。　　动画化《美少女战士》官方称它将会于2014年7月在NICONICO动画网站中全球同步开播，这对于许多粉丝来说 ，绝对是一个非常好的消息，另外，大家之前就一直非常关注的动画制作如今也也公布了，其动画是将由东映动画负责制作的。而其动画的监督已经确定是在2009年参与过《ONE PIECE FILM STRONG WORLD》等杰出作品制作的境宗久担任，相信这个不会让大家失望吧。在系列构成方面，确定由小林雄次担任，此外，为此部作品献唱主题曲的如之前报道中所说的一样，是桃色幸运草Z组合。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,奇幻,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 02:03:55","classic":true,"classicRank":44,"franchise":"美少女战士","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/meishaonvzhanshiCrystaldiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"h